  "text": "UI Audit Restaurant A\nKIOSK ADMIN\nAhmedabad Flagship Store\nAPP\nRestaurant Admin\nKiosk Admin\nCtrl+K\nAssistant\nLogout\nWorkspace\nChoose branch\nAll restaurant · overview\nUI Audit Restaurant A — Main Branch · MAIN\nUI Audit Second Branch A · UIA2\nOrders, tables, inventory and devices belong to this branch.\nKIOSK OPERATIONS\nDashboard\nKiosk Terminals\nOrders\nLive Orders / KDS\nFloor / Tables\nCUSTOMER EXPERIENCE\nMenu & Categories\nMenu Templates\nCustomisations & Tax\nKiosk Welcome Screen\nKiosk Appearance & Content\nKiosk Combos & Deals\nOffers & Coupons\nPAYMENTS & SERVICE\nPayments & Payouts\nReceipt & E-Bill\nPrinters & Devices\nCustomer Feedback\nStaff & Roles (RBAC)\nReports & Analytics\nSYSTEM\nKiosk Settings\nSync & Devices\nSubscription Plans\nAudit Trail Logs\nBackup & Restore\nHelp & Support\nApp Downloads\nDatabase Backup & Disaster Recovery\nCLOUD BACKUP ENABLED\n\nThis restaurant is connected to JAMANVAAR Cloud — backups can be stored off-device, not just downloaded to this computer.\n\nLast backup on this device: 10/13/2026, 9:07:17 PM\nCloud Backup (Off-Device)\nRecommended\n\nUploads a compressed snapshot to JAMANVAAR Cloud storage — survives this device failing entirely.\n\nBackup to Cloud Now\nExport Complete Database JSON\nRecommended\n\nDownload a complete portable JSON snapshot containing all orders, menu items, BOM recipes, tables, customers, shifts, and settings.\n\nDownload Backup JSON\nRestore Database Snapshot\n\nUpload and restore database state from a previously saved JAMANVAAR JSON snapshot file. Validates JSON schema before applying.\n\nUpload & Restore\nFactory Demo Seed Reset\n\nNot available once connected to JAMANVAAR Cloud — this restaurant's real menu is shared with every device; replacing it locally with placeholder demo dishes would just be overwritten by the next sync anyway.\n\nReset Seed Data\nJAMAN AI\nACTIVE\nKELVIONTECH ENTERPRISE\nLocal Engine Active\nOFFLINE-FIRST INDIAN RESTAURANT SYSTEM\nv2.0 • POWERED BY KELVIONTECH\n\nYOUR RESTAURANT WORKSPACE\n\nKIOSK MANAGEMENT\nCore Engine Ready\n•\nDatabase Initialized\n•\nLocal-First Mode",
